sec.p:
One easy way of obtaining randomized SMILES is by randomizing atom ordering. This does not alter how the algorithm traverses the graph (i.e., depth-first in the case of RDKit), but changes the starting point and in what order the branching paths are selected. With this approach, theoretically, at most \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
