				\begin{document}$$n$$\end{document}n heavy atoms, yet the resulting number of different combinations ends up being much lower. The two different variants of randomized SMILES used here (Fig. 1b, c) only change on the application of the RDKit fixes. This makes the unrestricted version a superset of the restricted one, which includes the SMILES that are disallowed in the regular restricted version.

